Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.318","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"45275b5e-5604-4e18-8d54-7bed398a80c8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bd0c8ca5-23f4-4bcd-88a6-2a91eca8e739","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TTdLkmYmfpVKPiDtKBSoqZ","type":"tool_result","content":"## Path & filesystem safety\n\n- Brain-relative reads and writes reject `..`, absolute paths, and symlinked\n  components, and verify the resolved path stays inside the brain root\n  (`rejectSymlinkPathComponents` / `rejectExistingSymlinkPathComponents`).\n- Lock files (both `internal/cli` and `internal/config`) open with `O_NOFOLLOW`\n  and reject symlinks, hardlinks, and open-file aliasing.\n- The `checkpoint_remote` repo from `.entire/settings.json` must be a clean\n  `owner/name` slug (`validateGitHubRepoSlug`); the fetch host is hardcoded to\n  github.com.\n\n## Egress threat model\n\n- No-egress mode (`ENTIRE_BRAIN_NO_EGRESS`, deprecated alias\n  `ENTIRE_BRAIN_LOCAL_ONLY`) is\n  **fail-closed**: any unrecognized toggle value is treated as enabled (with a\n  warning), and only `--agent ollama`/`none` are permitted — any other or\n  unknown agent name is denied (`agent_policy.go`).\n- Loopback-only HTTP clients (distill + embedder) disable proxies, restrict\n  redirects to loopback, and re-resolve the dial target at connection time,\n  rejecting any non-loopback IP. This defeats `localhost`-by-name trust, hostile\n  `/etc/hosts`, and DNS rebinding.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c9285347-ecb8-4e6c-8d8c-edf1c94edd48","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:06:03.919Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Path & filesystem safety\n\n- Brain-relative reads and writes reject `..`, absolute paths, and symlinked\n  components, and verify the resolved path stays inside the brain root\n  (`rejectSymlinkPathComponents` / `rejectExistingSymlinkPathComponents`).\n- Lock files (both `internal/cli` and `internal/config`) open with `O_NOFOLLOW`\n  and reject symlinks, hardlinks, and open-file aliasing.\n- The `checkpoint_remote` repo from `.entire/settings.json` must be a clean\n  `owner/name` slug (`validateGitHubRepoSlug`); the fetch host is hardcoded to\n  github.com.\n\n## Egress threat model\n\n- No-egress mode (`ENTIRE_BRAIN_NO_EGRESS`, deprecated alias\n  `ENTIRE_BRAIN_LOCAL_ONLY`) is\n  **fail-closed**: any unrecognized toggle value is treated as enabled (with a\n  warning), and only `--agent ollama`/`none` are permitted — any other or\n  unknown agent name is denied (`agent_policy.go`).\n- Loopback-only HTTP clients (distill + embedder) disable proxies, restrict\n  redirects to loopback, and re-resolve the dial target at connection time,\n  rejecting any non-loopback IP. This defeats `localhost`-by-name trust, hostile\n  `/etc/hosts`, and DNS rebinding.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ac820981-01b9-4ada-b51b-222da936b68e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","branch":"win/full-support","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"45275b5e-5604-4e18-8d54-7bed398a80c8","permissionDecision":{"decision":"ac