{"parentUuid":"a53208be-1ce9-41d9-8546-edc52c8fd650","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cgwh3bzSkXnFYSXnw4h4n","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Standing down. Here's your Windows checklist.\n\n**Run this from the `brain-windows` worktree root on your Windows box:**\n\n```\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce/scratchpad/windows-verify.ps1\n```\n\nIt checks five things, in order of how likely they are to find something real:\n\n1. **Store path** — standalone `entire-brain.exe` and `entire brain` must resolve the *same* store, under `%LOCALAPPDATA%`. This is the bug that made a standalone run read an empty brain silently.\n2. **`ProcessAlive`** — runs my Windows-only regression test, including the exited-child case that previously reported \"still running\" forever.\n3. **doctor** — the OneDrive/UNC warning fires if your profile is redirected, and importantly stays *quiet* if it isn't.\n4. **Long path** — writes a 277-char-shaped path under a temp root and reports your `LongPathsEnabled` setting. If this fails, the export layout is a live bug on your machine.\n5. **Full suite** — `go test ./...` on Windows, which is the real regression check.\n\n**Then by hand:** `entire brain setup` in a repo, and close the terminal while the backfill is still running. It should survive now, with no console flash. That's the one thing no script can check.\n\n**If anything fails**, paste the output and I'll fix it — that's the half of this loop that's still mine.\n\nState as I leave it: two commits on `win/full-support`, working tree clean, nothing pushed, no PR. Nothing of mine left on your machine except the worktree and the script (I removed the PowerShell container images I pulled).\n\nSeparately, `WINDOWS-PR-REVIEW-NOTES.md` has the cli queue decisions. The cheapest one is approving fork workflows — five of those PRs have never run CI at all, so nobody can review them responsibly yet.\n\nSince you've stood me down rather than the condition being met, the `finish` goal won't clear itself — `/goal clear` will."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":424113,"cache_read_input_tokens":29389,"output_tokens":1192,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":502},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":424113,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1192,"cache_read_input_tokens":29389,"cache_creation_input_tokens":424113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":424113},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}},"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fb2e4ba0-97a2-494f-9210-b2b42b6c443b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgwh3b86gQSFtjDdcUBHP","requestRef":"1f6600c5-a791-4af5-a97b-ce9b47a9611e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"5cb77d81-3784-4cc1-835f-6539707818e2","timestamp":"2026-11-11T19:27:28.503Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"338a84d2-8297-4418-9431-614af31d9617","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.318","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
