 TestHistoryFTSDirectSecurityAndAuthoritativeFailures, TestAbstractResolverCarriesAffectedJobIssue, TestAbstractEgressTargetReaderRejectsShardAndLeafSymlinks, TestAbstractPrivacyCleanupNeverFollowsExternalSymlinks, TestAbstractReadsFailClosedOnAdversarialArtifacts, TestPatternCorpusPublishDirectorySwapCannotTouchExternalTarget, TestFactAvailabilityRejectsEmptyCorruptAndSymlinkStores, TestWorktreeFingerprintSkipsSymlinksInsideUntrackedDirectory, TestSemanticChangesDefaultDoesNotAcquireIndexLock, TestSemanticContextContentSkipsSymlinkedRepoPath, TestSemanticIndexRejectsSymlinkedLockDirectory, TestSemanticIndexRejectsSymlinkedBrainRoot, TestSemanticIndexRejectsSymlinkedBrainParent, TestSemanticIndexRejectsSymlinkedSnapshotDestination, TestBundleExportRejectsSymlinkedAuditLog, TestBundleExportRejectsSymlinkAncestorIntoBrainDir, TestBundleExportRejectsSymlinkOutputIntoBrainDir, TestBundleImportRejectsSymlinkedAuditLog, TestBundleExportRejectsSymlinkOutput, TestWorkspaceRejectsSymlinkedWorkspacePath, TestWorkspaceCreateIgnoresSymlinkedLegacyTree, TestSkillFileExistsSeesDanglingSymlink, TestSkillWriteRefusesSymlinkedBase, TestSkillWriteRefusesSymlinkedDestination, TestPathRefusesSymlinkedStoreRoot, TestHeadPathForKeyAppliesTheSameGuardsAsBrainDirForKey\n\nTESTS IN package agentsetup (internal/agentsetup/*_test.go):\nTestActivationContainedAlias, TestActivationDoesNotReadOutsideRepo, TestCoordinationLegacyAliasesAndProtectedTargets\n\nVERIFY BEFORE REPORTING (run each; do not chain through `head`/`tail` in a way that hides a non-zero exit):\n  cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows\n  gofmt -l internal/cli internal/agentsetup          # must print nothing\n  go build ./...                                      # must exit 0\n  go vet ./internal/cli ./internal/agentsetup         # must exit 0\n  GOMAXPROCS=4 go test ./internal/agentsetup -count=1\n  GOMAXPROCS=4 go test ./internal/cli -count=1 -run 'TestBrainBriefGitIntentRejectsSymlinkAndTimeout|TestPrecedentSourcesDegradeAndDedupe|TestBrainManifestReaderKeepsFileProtections|TestHistoryFTSDirectSecurityAndAuthoritativeFailures|TestAbstractResolverCarriesAffectedJobIssue|TestAbstractEgressTargetReaderRejectsShardAndLeafSymlinks|TestAbstractPrivacyCleanupNeverFollowsExternalSymlinks|TestAbstractReadsFailClosedOnAdversarialArtifacts|TestPatternCorpusPublishDirectorySwapCannotTouchExternalTarget|TestFactAvailabilityRejectsEmptyCorruptAndSymlinkStores|TestWorktreeFingerprintSkipsSymlinksInsideUntrackedDirectory|TestSemanticChangesDefaultDoesNotAcquireIndexLock|TestSemanticContextContentSkipsSymlinkedRepoPath|TestSemanticIndexRejectsSymlinked|TestBundleExportRejectsSymlink|TestBundleImportRejectsSymlinkedAuditLog|TestWorkspaceRejectsSymlinkedWorkspacePath|TestWorkspaceCreateIgnoresSymlinkedLegacyTree|TestSkillFileExistsSeesDanglingSymlink|TestSkillWriteRefusesSymlinked|TestPathRefusesSymlinkedStoreRoot|TestHeadPathForKeyAppliesTheSameGuardsAsBrainDirForKey'\nAll must pass on macOS (symlinks DO work here, so these run for real — they must still PASS, not skip; a skip on macOS means you broke something).\n\nCONSTRAINTS\n- Do not run the full ./... test suite (CPU contention with other sessions). Only the targeted runs above.\n- Use rtk for git/shell where available.\n- No new files except edits to existing _test.go files.\n\nREPORT (caveman-ultra compressed, no prose paragraphs):\n- files touched + count of conversions per file\n- any site you did NOT convert + one-line reason\n- exact pass/fail of each verify command\n- anything ambiguous you had to judge","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/1041b1a0-c015-41c2-a29f-4f2db2f6e0cb/tasks/a4189baa321ca86b8.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3fded4e5-f486-4b1f-b2a2-65913d1a648f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","branch":"win/full-support","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"count