{"parentUuid":"a5664392-b6ee-4055-9ca3-454d2a1f9e5b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"auto_mode","autoModeConsentFlow":false,"finishExposedWork":false,"bashFirst":true,"bashFirstSteer":"strict","steerOnly":true,"bypass":false},"type":"attachment","uuid":"34896859-09e6-42b5-acb7-2de139f8907b","timestamp":"2026-11-17T22:50:45.110Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nWhile auto mode is active:\n\nDo your work through the Bash tool wherever it can accomplish the job: read files with cat, head, or sed -n, search with grep and find, and make file changes with sed, heredocs, or short scripts, rather than using the dedicated Read, Edit, or Write tools. Fall back to a dedicated tool only when Bash genuinely cannot do the job.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
