`go version`, `$PSVersionTable.PSVersion`, whether the host\n   `entire` CLI was present, whether a repo encloses your home or temp dir.\n2. The script's **full output**, verbatim.\n3. Per section: PASS / FAIL / NOT RUN, with exact text for anything but PASS.\n4. The manual detached-backfill result.\n5. For any suite failure, the attribution: pre-existing or regression.\n6. Anything you could not do and why.\n\n**Do not round a partial result up.** \"Section 1 ran only its weaker half\" is a\nuseful report; \"Section 1 passed\" implies a comparison that did not happen.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9ab1cff8-e04a-4c2e-af53-bd12b6cd305a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","branch":"win/full-support","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"53a17d8d-63f9-4827-a654-237a9b05950e","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"1041b1a0-c015-41c2-a29f-4f2db2f6e0cb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8