t \"C\"` with no\n   pure-Go fallback, so `GOOS=windows CGO_ENABLED=0 go build ./...` fails for every grammar.\n   Irrelevant for released binaries; a real barrier for a Windows contributor, who needs\n   mingw-w64 before the repo builds at all. brain needs none of this (pure Go, including\n   `modernc.org/sqlite`). Not a defect, but it belongs in the contributor docs.\n\n### What the run could not see\n\nThe suite was exercised on an LF checkout, so **graph's test suite has never been run on a\ndefault CRLF Windows checkout**. brain's has (the kit cloned without touching\n`core.autocrlf` on a machine where it was on, and the suite was green), which is why brain\ncan say the CRLF exposure is gofmt-only. Graph cannot say that yet. Given item 2 above, it\nis worth one run before anyone calls graph's Windows support complete.\nEOF\necho \"=== appended; new length: $(wc -l < GRAPH-FEEDBACK.md) lines ===\"; tail -6 GRAPH-FEEDBACK.md","description":"Append graph review handoff to feedback file"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01VMmHjYhq6JQ8ZWSTsrHHFx":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"8cd7445b-701c-4b10-918b-31f4bb66aa90","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011ChBRfax8UZ6dQn48iA4k1","requestRef":"68f50be4-c959-4460-a2d4-3f533d8aa382","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"45c646d9-55f2-4066-99d8-628fa2c42fb5","timestamp":"2026-11-19T01:34:19.283Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"1041b1a0-c015-41c2-a29f-4f2db2f6e0cb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
