— ratio 0.436 vs Opus 0.980; cheap-model hope closed\n- [Cost decomposition](cost-decomposition-closes-25pct.md) — cacheRead 48.9/output 32.9/cacheCreation 18.2% of cost; COST +5.21%\n- [The fair number is 2.5%](the-fair-number-is-2-5-percent.md) — n=75 COST +2.49% CI [−6.83,+11.18], median NEGATIVE\n- [Cross-cell comparison is confounded](cross-cell-comparison-is-confounded.md) — same config 26pt apart; only paired-on-identic\n- [Selected extremes can't test regression](selected-extremes-cannot-test-regression.md) — RTM drops selected winners median 109\n- [Mechanism endpoint caught a false headline](mechanism-endpoint-caught-a-false-headline.md) — score AND mechanism rose = basel\n- [Estimator flips the sign](estimator-flips-the-sign.md) — pooled +8.73% vs equal-weighted −3.02%; nine loss-tail predictors de\n- [Per-loser forensics doctrine](per-loser-forensics-doctrine.md) — investigate each loser; fix the defect CLASS; re-verify winn\n- [Benchmark arm-fairness bugs](benchmark-arm-fairness-bugs.md) — audit the HARNESS before the tool; verify.run was eg-only in a\n- [Load pressure is an arm confound](load-pressure-is-an-arm-confound.md) — starvation inflates whichever arm runs under it, fli\n- [eg A/B cache trap](eg-ab-testing-cache-trap.md) — index cache tree-keyed not binary-keyed; separate --cache-dir per build\n- [eg nested worktrees kill cache](eg-nested-worktrees-kill-cache.md) — .claude/worktrees/* blows 64-path digest budget; ~5s per\n- [Stale baseline contamination](stale-baseline-contamination.md) — Haiku/Sonnet baselines predate env-repair clamp; diff prompt\n- [VERIFY command fails fairness](verify-command-fails-fairness.md) — runnable test command = arm-asymmetric HELP, not tool outp\n- [claude --safe-mode strips MCP](claude-safe-mode-strips-mcp.md) — silently removes ALL MCP servers; only check = ask model its\n- [Usage is NOT the lever](usage-is-not-the-lever.md) — more graph calls = WORSE (corr −0.166); call count is a difficulty signa\n- [Agentic token saving is the clamp](agentic-token-saving-is-the-clamp.md) — CAUSAL: frugality prompt not graph; unclamped −25.\n- [Graph savings scale with session length](graph-savings-scale-with-session-length.md) — saves by deleting locate turns; short-\n\n- [Paired deltas decay with n](paired-deltas-decay-with-n.md) — +2.00 at n=400 became −0.39 at n=1540; never report before full\n- [mem0 is more context-efficient](mem0-is-more-context-efficient.md) — 43.2 vs our 5.7 pts/1k chars; top_k equalises items not\n- [P1 client/server interop fork](p1-client-server-interop-fork.md) — brain #85 vs api #242 disagree: proposal paths, settle mod\n- [Brain onboarding plan](brain-onboarding-plan.md) — setup=instant core + bg backfill + workspace-watch daemon (user WANTS daem\n- [Keystone 3 PRs open](keystone-3-prs-open.md) — graph #114 + cli #2041 + brain #87 wire-compatible, 2 adversarial rounds, awai\n- [LoCoMo terra result](locomo-terra-result.md) — brain full-n 90.84% w/ gpt-5.6-terra; terra≈gpt-5; metric ≠ the 94.74 table\n- [entire-graph CWE-59 symlink writes](entire-graph-symlink-write-cwe59.md) — init-agents appends + index --report TRUNCATES out\n- [BrainMark state](brainmark-state.md) — **DO NOT FUND confirmatory until #166-#174 merge**; 2026-08-29 harness audit: 9 defect\n- [Competitor token multipliers are naive ratios](competitor-token-multipliers-are-naive-ratios.md) — graphify 79x = corpus ÷ on\n- [PreToolUse hook: product, not benchmark](pretooluse-hook-is-product-not-benchmark.md) — targets 42% no-substitution cohort; I\n- [P1.M7 storage substrate verdict](p1m7-storage-substrate-verdict.md) — refstore CAS sound for fact heads; rsl NO server-side a\n- [run.py clamps are arm-asymmetric](runpy-clamps-are-arm-asymmetric.md) — no_brain baseline gets ZERO frugality clamps, tool co\n- [graphmark metrics token-source bug](graphmark-metrics-token-source-bug.md) — usage.* not modelUsage, arm-dependent, 36x worst\n- [brain CI gate split trust](brain-ci-gate-split-trust.md) — Go PRs green = trustworthy; harness PRs never in CI until #181; re\n- [cli check runs real agents](cli-check-runs-real-agents.md) — `mise run check` runs real claude+pi on a dev machine (live mode\n- [transcript chunking has no count field](transcript-chunking-has-no-count-field.md) — cli records no chunk count; readers must\n- [MCP plugin /tmp path rot](mcp-plugin-tmp-path-rot.md) — CONNECTION_CLOSED = plugin points at purged /tmp; reinstall from dura\n- [brain not on api main — entire-api is ARCHIVED; brainstore IS DEPLOYED (5 prod + 3 nonprod Aurora regions)\n- [auth-go redirect credential leak](authgo-redirect-credential-leak.md) — **HIGH, every released tag**: credential POSTs follow\n- [Shared /tmp is contended across agents](shared-tmp-contended-across-agents.md) — cp to /tmp can return another agent's file\n- [Trail finding sweep pitfalls](trail-finding-sweep-pitfalls.md) — five silent zeros incl. NEUTRAL gate; read the gate output t\n- [Brain blocked on review capacity](brain-blocked-on-review-capacity.md) — 90 open PRs, 0 reviews; main red 17d; #192+#194 MERG\n- [Brain extraction verdict](brain-extraction-verdict.md) — touches only brainstore/brainbuild/httpapi; package boundary NOW as\n- [Graph PRs awaiting approval](graph-prs-awaiting-approval.md) — 16 PRs green but Approvals; ~200 findings closed; gate red !=\n- [Stats savings was inflated](stats-savings-was-inflated.md) — 82.9M vs honest ~46k (~1800x); savings disagreeing with paired b\n- [Brain: next two actions](brain-next-two-actions.md) — main's fix + setup fixes DONE and pushed; main GREEN after #192+#194; s\n- [Setup UI is TTY-gated](brain-setup-ui-is-tty-gated.md) — never judge a TUI through a pipe; colour/spinner gate on Caps.TTY; a\n- [Brain is a separate plugin binary](brain-is-a-separate-plugin-binary.md) — runs ~/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin/entire-brai\n- [entire trail resolves by origin](entire-trail-cli-resolves-by-origin.md) — pass `--repo gh/entireio/...`; always `--json`; re\n- [git stash is shared across worktrees](git-stash-shared-across-worktrees.md) — one refs/stash for ALL worktrees; parallel stas\n- [Twelve-gap campaign](twelve-gap-campaign.md) — all 12 gaps closed (#303-#315 + graph #264); 0 open findings; only Approvals b\n- [Brain does not scale past ~5M lines](brain-does-not-scale-past-5m-lines.md) — LINEAR: 12.3s p50, 1.17GB at 4.8M lines; ~100x\n- [Verified-by-weakening doctrine](verified-by-weakening-doctrine.md) — patch each guard, prove test goes red; caught ~8 unfaila\n- [FTS5 trigram refuted](semantic-fts5-trigram-refuted.md) — symbol_fts has no index, but trigram 2.2x slower on real queries +\n- [Scale latency is diffuse](scale-latency-is-diffuse.md) — profiled: SQL 44%/git 15%/load 41%, no hotspot; trigram AND one-pass\n- [Brain prose vs symbol verbs](brain-prose-vs-symbol-verbs.md) — query/search/vsearch are PROSE only; `inspect search-graph` is\n- [Brain facts are branch-scoped](brain-facts-are-branch-scoped.md) — worktree recall returns 0 rows silently; `--branch main` o\n- [Ollama distill economics](ollama-distill-economics.md) — STOPPED 169/203, 694 facts; rate/yield vary 4x-15x head-to-tail, ear\n- [FORCE_COLOR breaks local tests](force-color-breaks-local-tests.md) — FORCE_COLOR=3 in this shell; colour-assert tests fail lo\n- [Sessions only capture inside the repo](sessions-only-capture-inside-the-repo.md) — launch from devenv/ captures NOTHING, sile\n- [Unseen is not impossible](unseen-is-not-impossible.md) — I upgrade \"haven't observed it\" to \"cannot exist\"; 3x in one session\n- [A green suite is not evidence](green-suite-is-not-evidence.md) — mutation sweep: 8/15 guards unheld incl. one I just fixed; t\n- [Containment for exactness](containment-for-exactness.md) — substring/shape test standing in for the exact check its name clai\n- [Logic in the call site](logic-in-the-call-site.md) — 5 defects lived in ORDER of two calls, unreachable from any suite; make\n- [Mutation didn't fire? Suspect the test](mutation-didnt