{"parentUuid":"51307c9f-de3e-4392-9ee0-a4ca1a20e393","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011ChCySsApSWNF4rPNcuRwz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Written to **`/Users/suhaan/devenv/GRAPH-WINDOWS-PROMPT.md`**. Still no graph session live (five peers, all unrelated), so this is a hand-off file rather than a `SendMessage`.\n\nTo use it:\n\n```\ncd ~/devenv/entire-graph && claude\n```\n\nthen paste the file's contents, or just `read ~/devenv/GRAPH-WINDOWS-PROMPT.md and do it`.\n\n**What the prompt makes the graph agent do**\n\nIt is written as *review → fix → finalize*, not just review, because three of the five real problems are in no PR at all:\n\n- **The four PRs** (#416–#419) with branch names, the carried-over verdicts, and what finishing each means. #418 is a confirm; #416 and #417 hinge on one design decision each; **#419 is the only one told to write code** — reproduce the stock-PowerShell failure first, then either add the `--output` flag or reject UTF-16 with a message that names PowerShell's default, and keep the issue open either way.\n- **The three unticketed items**: graph's missing `.gitattributes` (with my brain implementation named as the reference, flagged as local-only so they don't go looking for it on the remote), the CRLF-checkout run that has never happened, and cgo as an undocumented contributor wall.\n- **The two judgement calls** that are genuinely theirs: whether to share one ceiling resolver instead of three copies across two repos, and whether `sem`'s 156 symlink sites earn a helper. For the first I told them to agree the shape with the brain session over `SendMessage` before anything touches brain's repo.\n\n**Guardrails carried in explicitly**: no merging/approving/closing/pushing to main, lanes, no AI footers, flock for board writes, no bare `git stash`, `uptime` before heavy runs, and the CONTRIBUTING verification bar — weakening proof, grep `--- FAIL` not `^FAIL`, and that `gofmt -l -s .` must be tested on its *output* because its exit code is 0 even when it lists files.\n\nI also told it not to work in `~/devenv/entire-graph` — I checked, it's still at `d4a0c186`, ~226 commits behind, dirty tree. That staleness is what produced the wrong findings earlier in this whole effort, so it's worth the line.\n\nOne thing the prompt asserts that I verified just now rather than carried over: `gh api repos/entireio/entire-graph/contents/.gitattributes` returns 404, so graph genuinely has no `.gitattributes` on main today.\n\nUnchanged and still waiting on you: `git push -u origin win/go-eol-lf` in `~/devenv/brain-goeol` — auto mode denied it as destructive, so brain's gofmt fix is committed at `7873db4d` and verified but has no remote branch."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5496,"cache_read_input_tokens":128923,"output_tokens":1090,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":146},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5496,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1090,"cache_read_input_tokens":128923,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5496,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5496},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"88812749-1f40-444a-9438-9dc53dc1554f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011ChCySrhYGyDKGkEYchcKB","requestRef":"9089be9c-9ae2-4b59-9f58-27e5536a1eab","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"2c7f71ad-8c2f-4d47-8e77-da4255ee6cce","timestamp":"2026-11-19T21:11:21.956Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"1041b1a0-c015-41c2-a29f-4f2db2f6e0cb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-goeol","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
